# The owner's first drill (2026-09-29). Sneak up under cover, ready the weapon, strike from the
# flank; if seen far off, melt away; if seen close, shoot first; go in when the enemy wavers.
# Retuned 2026-10-05 after trials: the ambush starts at 25 m (it was 12), the smoke is used to
# close in, and melting away is kept for long range only - backing off from every glance at
# middle range left them shot in the back. With the Shinobi type: 6-154 became 55-105.
drill "Ninjas"
about "Creep from cover to cover toward his flank, weapon ready. Unseen and close: the blade. Seen close: shoot first from cover. Seen far off: melt away. The smoke is a friend."
type Shinobi
dials aggression 0.55 discipline 0.25 cohesion 0.10 cover 1.00 patience 0.90 nerve 0.70

sergeant:
  when enemy breaking or enemy broken                  -> charge
  # seen from far off (and not hidden by smoke): melt away
  when spotted and enemy beyond 50 and enemy within 90 and not in smoke -> fall back 15; find cover
  when losing the exchange                             -> fall back 25; find cover; form skirmish
  otherwise                                            -> advance slow; find cover; form skirmish; hold fire

man:
  # the enemy wavers or runs: everyone goes in
  when ( enemy breaking or enemy broken or enemy losses over 40% ) and enemy within 40 -> charge
  # someone else has their attention: take them in the flank
  when enemy engaged elsewhere and enemy within 40      -> charge
  # men of theirs running: cut them down
  when enemy running nearby and enemy within 40        -> charge
  # the smoke hides them: close in under it and go in
  when smoke between us and enemy within 35           -> charge
  # close and unseen: the blade
  when enemy within 25 and not spotted                 -> charge
  when enemy within 12                                 -> charge
  # they turned and saw me: shoot first, from cover
  when spotted and loaded and enemy within 40 and in cover -> fire
  when spotted and loaded and enemy within 20          -> fire
  when spotted and not in cover                        -> take cover within 12
  when spotted                                         -> hold kneeling
  # ready the weapon while nobody is looking
  when not loaded                                      -> reload kneeling
  otherwise                                            -> sneak 16
